WEBVTT

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:03.420
Gorgonic Guardian, Direct Attack!

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:09.930
What are you doing here?!

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:12.990
I followed you guys.

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:14.860
You want to settle things right now?!

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:21.540
Durbe, do we really need to fight each other?!

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:23.640
Why say that now?

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:27.110
I mean... You saved us before!

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:30.650
If you hadn't been with us back in those ruins then,

00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:32.810
there's no telling what would've happened to us!

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:34.880
That's why...!

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:37.090
You made that assumption on your own.

00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:40.990
In the end, it is our fate to fight one another.

00:00:40.990 --> 00:00:42.790
C'mon, Durbe...

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:45.530
The legends of the ruins are about you guys, aren't they?!

00:00:47.430 --> 00:00:49.530
I'm not sure what happened,

00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:52.770
but you guys were once human just like us!

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:57.140
So why do you have to fight against Astral?!

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:59.440
Stop joking!

00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:04.110
We were humans, you say?!
 I will not believe such a story!

00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:08.720
The Barian World and the Astral World
 are worlds opposing one another.

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:11.850
And we are destined to fight against one another!

00:01:11.850 --> 00:01:14.160
Why's it have to come to that?

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:16.310
Then you and Astral both...

00:01:16.310 --> 00:01:18.590
...don't even know why you're fighting each other!

00:01:18.590 --> 00:01:22.060
You shouldn't fight for such a stupid reason!

00:01:24.070 --> 00:01:26.000
<i>Yuma...</i>

00:01:27.230 --> 00:01:29.330
No matter what you say...

00:01:29.330 --> 00:01:31.960
...we have no reason to live together.

00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:32.970
Isn't that right, Astral?

00:01:32.970 --> 00:01:35.710
My mission is to...

00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:39.180
...destroy the Barian World.

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:42.850
A-Astral...

00:02:05.090 --> 00:02:12.640
<i>Being best friends doesn't mean we always were</i>

00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:15.690
<i>That's pretty much true</i>

00:02:15.980 --> 00:02:23.150
<i>I found you during our serious battles</i>

00:02:23.320 --> 00:02:26.700
<i>The other me inside myself</i>

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:31.580
<i>Awakening from within the conflict</i>

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:37.920
<i>A turn for a chance! Seize it! Draw!</i>

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:41.130
<i>Duel! Dualism!</i>

00:02:41.130 --> 00:02:44.010
<i>These cards are polished to fit each other</i>

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:48.640
<i>My fated opponent is my heart reflected through the mirror</i>

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:51.720
<i>And if we end up with a "tie" in the end,</i>

00:02:51.720 --> 00:03:00.190
<i>when we fall, all covered with mud, we'll praise each other</i>

00:03:15.550 --> 00:03:20.170
"Shark vs. the Roaring Waterfall Deity - Abyss! 
Collision: the Two Numbers!!"

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:28.100
This place is...

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:31.140
This vision again...

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:35.150
Your Highness, I come bearing a report.

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:38.070
Our army is at a severe disadvantage out there.

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:42.610
Vector's army is using the Gorgons to break through our defenses one by one.

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:46.660
It's just a matter of time before they invade our country and occupy the castle...!

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:55.750
If this keeps up, he'll not only massacre our country, but all our neighboring lands!

00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:59.010
So what the hell do you want me to-

00:03:59.010 --> 00:03:59.710
Dear brother!

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:03.890
Everyone is awaiting your orders!

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:04.680
From me?

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:10.140
That is right. You must give orders as 
this country's king and their leader!

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:13.310
Screw this! Leader?!

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:16.110
Don't push your lives onto me!

00:04:16.110 --> 00:04:18.320
M-My King...?

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:20.570
What's wrong with you, dear brother?!

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:26.120
Are you not the leader of this land who joined together the Allied Nations of Poseidon?!

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:29.370
You have always protected the peace of this land!

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:32.790
Me? I did that...?

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:34.790
<i>Overcome it!</i>

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:40.000
<i>Overcome this ordeal!</i>

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:45.470
<i>Fighting in in this world is no different than winning a Duel.</i>

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:47.850
If you do, you will...

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:50.140
Be quiet!

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:53.810
My ordeal...

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:55.850
My King...

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:57.270
Dear brother?

00:04:58.820 --> 00:05:00.650
God...?

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:04.700
I'm no leader.

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:08.070
But when it comes to both the world and Dueling...

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:09.660
...losing would really piss me off!

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:12.580
Send new soldiers to aid the army!

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:20.800
<i>Did that guy also show me that vision just now...?</i>

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:23.260
<i>Just what is this vision...?</i>

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:26.720
I will now end my turn.

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:29.930
<i>But that was useful just now...</i>

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:32.010
<i>The Gorgons destroy themselves with their own power...</i>

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:36.390
<i>In that case, I've got a card that can help me out of this situation!</i>

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:40.900
<i>The card you gave me in order to test me...</i>

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:42.730
My turn! Draw!

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:48.280
I activate the Quick-Play Magic, Absolute Zero, from my hand!

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:55.410
This card makes the Attack Power of an Xyz Monster with no Overlay Units zero!

00:05:55.410 --> 00:06:00.750
Useless. Thanks to my Monster's Equip Magic, Xyz Unit,

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:04.550
when an effect that detaches Overlay Units is activated,

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:07.010
I can detach this card instead.

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:11.640
Unfortunately, even if you use its effect,

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:14.270
that card isn't an Overlay Unit!

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:17.100
Thus, because of the effect of Absolute Zero,

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:19.730
Gorgonic Guardian's Attack Power becomes zero!

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:26.070
And at this moment, Gorgonic Guardian's effect activates!

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:30.160
All Monsters on the field with zero Attack Points will be destroyed!

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:33.280
Be destroyed by your own power!

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:49.340
Now! Bring out the mirror shields!

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:02.610
I don't know what kind of test this is, but...

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:07.110
Here goes! I Summon Depth Shark!

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:12.660
When I have no cards on the field, I can Summon this card without release!

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:16.870
Depth Shark, Direct Attack!

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:25.710
I set one card face-down and end my turn!

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:30.130
Now, let's settle this.

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:33.090
Let's Duel!

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:36.390
Durbe... I have something to ask you before we Duel.

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:42.140
Among the Seven Barian Emperors,
 there are two we have not met.

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:47.150
These ruins should most likely
 hold the legends surrounding these two.

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:51.610
Why haven't those two shown themselves before us?

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:58.870
Those two are the leaders of us Seven Barian Emperors, Nasch and Merag.

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:01.040
They are certainly alive.

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:02.330
And they will come back!

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:04.580
Yuma!

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:06.710
Wh-What?!

00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:11.170
Wh-What's that?!

00:08:13.470 --> 00:08:15.220
Th-That's Shark!

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:17.300
Could he be...?!

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:20.390
Did he already start a Duel?!

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:24.350
Shark's little sister?!

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:27.520
Then the opponent Shark's Dueling against is...

00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:32.320
Why are they Dueling in these ruins...?

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:35.450
I'll settle things with you guys next time!

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:37.660
H-Hey, wait!

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:40.490
Ow...!

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:43.660
Darn it! It ain't fair to just fly off!

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:47.130
We gotta get over to Shark!

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:51.010
But to do that, we must get through this labyrinth...

00:08:57.470 --> 00:09:00.720
<i>That's the hole Durbe came in through...</i>

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:02.980
Yuma! Your cards!

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:03.600
Huh?

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:05.390
Call out Needle Swordsman!

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:07.650
Needle Swordsman?

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:10.230
I'll explain later! Hurry!

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:15.700
<i>Ryouga Kamishiro...</i>

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:19.160
My turn! Draw!

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:22.620
At this moment, Depth Shark's effect activates!

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:27.080
This card's Attack Power doubles during my opponent's turn only!

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:30.340
I need to end this Duel as fast as possible!

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:33.050
But will it go that smoothly?

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:36.050
Right! Follow Needle Swordsman!

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:39.300
Right! Past the water up ahead!

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:42.100
The end of the maze lies where the water ends!

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:48.980
I activate the Magic Card, Gorgonic Ritual!

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:53.440
This card Banishes one Rock-Type Xyz Monster from my Graveyard.

00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:56.570
I Banish Gorgonic Guardian!

00:09:56.570 --> 00:10:01.990
Then I can Special Summon two Rock-Type Monsters from my Graveyard in Defense Position.

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:05.290
Be reborn, Gorgonic Golem! Gragoyle!

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:08.750
I then activate the Magic Card, Gorgonic Pile!

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:15.210
It allows me to raise the level of Gorgonic Monsters times the total number on my field!

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:18.340
I have two Gorgonic Monsters on the field.

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:20.760
Therefore, they increase by two levels!

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:22.100
Here it comes...

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:26.560
Ryouga, I will wake up your memory!

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:34.570
Lord Vector! The Gorgons are being destroyed by the enemy's mirror shields one by one...!

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:37.490
They've found the will so start fighting us back!

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:39.070
If this continues, our army will...!

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:44.620
Toss him into the sea!

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:48.080
I still have the Almighty God on my side!

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:54.210
Now! Take this blood as payment and grant me your power!

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:58.510
Appear before us, Almighty God!

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:00.550
Wh-What?!

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:10.190
Behold, Ryouga!

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:15.190
I Overlay the Level Five Gorgonic Golem and Gargoyle!

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:19.610
I use these two Monsters to build the Overlay Network!

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:21.110
Xyz Summon!

00:11:23.030 --> 00:11:24.530
Wh-What the?!

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:29.250
Come forth, Number 73!

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:38.420
The holy water drop falling into chaos!

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:42.430
Show your power and purify all disorder!

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:46.180
Abyss Splash the Roaring Waterfall Deity!

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:50.180
This guy's the Number of these ruins...?

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:57.020
This is...!

00:11:58.690 --> 00:12:01.280
What's going on up on the field?!

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:02.530
Let's go, Astral!

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:11.000
What the? Could this possibly be...?

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:12.460
The memories inside these ruins?!

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:20.010
Why...?! Why am I being shown...?!

00:12:21.050 --> 00:12:24.930
That's...! Ryouga Kamishiro's inside these memories...?!

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:27.680
That pendant is...!

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:31.640
For Vector of all people to call the God of the Sea...

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:36.400
He likely made a contract with the God using blood as the price...

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:39.860
In order to purify it...

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:52.160
My King!

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:03.840
Rio!

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:08.550
Rio...! Rio!

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:16.190
Rio!!

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:19.940
Rio...!

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:29.780
Rio!

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:31.120
Ryouga Kamishiro.

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:34.870
Your true ordeal begins now.

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:37.500
My name is Abyss.

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:40.420
The time has come for me to test your strength.

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:42.210
Damn you...!

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:47.090
I activate the effect of Number 73, Abyss Splash!

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:52.600
By detaching one Overlay Unit, I can double its Attack Power during a battle!

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:56.140
It's got 4800 Attack Points?!

00:13:57.100 --> 00:13:59.270
Now you are finished.

00:13:59.270 --> 00:14:01.690
Go, Abyss Splash!

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:03.780
Attack Depth Shark!

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:05.530
Final Fall!

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:12.530
Trap, activate! Hide and Shark!

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:16.460
If I have 2000 or less Life,

00:14:16.460 --> 00:14:18.830
when the opponent's Monster attacks,

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:22.460
this card can Banish a Shark Monster on the field

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:24.050
in order to end the battle.

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:27.880
But I have to pay half my Life as compensation!

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:35.390
Looks like you managed to survive.

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:40.270
I activate Hide and Shark's other effect!

00:14:40.270 --> 00:14:44.820
When the battle ends, the Banished Monster returns to the field.

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:50.740
The Monster gains Attack Points equal to the amount of Life paid to activate the card!

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:53.450
So you brought your Monster back, did you?

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:55.450
I will then end my turn.

00:14:55.990 --> 00:15:00.040
But you will not defeat my Monster with that level of strength!

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:13.970
Surrender to me!

00:15:14.470 --> 00:15:18.770
If you don't, your sister will disappear into the sea!

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:29.400
You're Durbe!

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:34.700
Do not be surprised, my friend!

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:37.620
Did you think I wouldn't come rushing to your aid?!

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:40.290
You say... you're my friend?

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:43.290
What are you doing?! Shoot him down!

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:49.880
This can't be...! My past is linked to Ryouga's...?!

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:54.340
Now choose! Will you save your sister or your country?!

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:59.680
So undo the evil curse...

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:02.940
...there is no choice but to purify the God with a holy payment.

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:05.150
Rio! What are you...?!

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:10.690
Dear brother, my soul shall cleanse Abyss.

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:12.360
Rio...!

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:21.290
Rio!

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:28.210
That's... the other Number of these ruins!

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:31.170
Could Shark and Rio be...?!

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:34.130
Are they Nasch and Merag...?!

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:38.850
No way...! Those were my memories just now...!

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:43.520
I couldn't save Rio...?

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:49.020
This field is exactly the same as your heart.

00:16:49.020 --> 00:16:54.820
You will once again lose your sister in this world as well.

00:16:54.820 --> 00:17:00.790
The weakness in your heart comes from losing that which is precious to you.

00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:03.460
Rio!

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:06.540
Yuma!

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:09.420
I'm gonna bring it to 'em!

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:21.520
Shark, your sister's safe!

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:24.980
Beat him down without worry!

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:26.350
Yuma...

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:32.690
This card is... the Number reincarnation of Rio...

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:38.740
Now, Ryouga, defeat me and regain your memories.

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:41.410
As a king, you must guide the world!

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:45.370
Stop screwing around! I'm no one like that!

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:47.170
I'm just me!

00:17:47.170 --> 00:17:49.790
My turn! Draw!

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:54.840
I activate the Equip Magic, Aqua Mirage, from my hand!

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:58.140
This card can be equipped to a Water-Attribute Monster

00:17:58.140 --> 00:18:01.390
and when the equipped Monster is used as Xyz Material,

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:05.640
I can use this card for an Xyz Material 
as a Monster with the same level!

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:10.020
And then, I activate the Magic Card, Resurrection of the Dead!

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:12.940
Revive, Black Ray Lancer!

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:16.030
And then I activate a Trap!

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:18.490
Full Armored Xyz!

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:23.370
This card activates by targeting one Xyz Monster I control,

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:28.330
First I Xyz Summon, and the Summoned Monster is equipped with the targeted Monster!

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:31.670
Then it gains the Attack Points of the equipped Monster!

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:34.960
The one I target is Black Ray Lancer!

00:18:35.510 --> 00:18:39.640
I Overlay the Level five Depth Shark and Aqua Mirage!

00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:44.430
I build the Overlay Network using one Monster as two!

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:46.270
Xyz Summon!

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:50.440
Come forth, Number 94!

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:57.490
Soul shrine maiden with a heart of ice, show your clear and bright soul before us!

00:18:57.490 --> 00:19:00.910
Crystal Zero the Polar Ice Princess!

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:11.750
I use the effect of Full-Armored Xyz to equip Black Ray Lancer to Crystal Zero!

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:20.680
Now Crystal Zero's Attack Power rises to 4300!

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:25.350
That will not happen. I activate Abyss Splash's effect!

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:29.690
By detaching one Overlay Unit, I double its Attack Power!

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:33.730
You're naive! I activate Crystal Zero's effect!

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:38.150
By detaching one Overlay Unit,
 I can halve one of the opponent's Attack Points!

00:19:38.150 --> 00:19:41.070
I detach two Overlay Units!

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:44.240
Crystal Eraser!

00:19:45.870 --> 00:19:49.710
Now Abyss Splash's Attack Power becomes 1200!

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:53.210
Go, Crystal Zero!

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:55.960
Tear Abyss Splash apart!

00:19:55.960 --> 00:19:57.550
Crystal Javelin!

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:14.190
You did it, Shark!

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:16.900
Why?

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:20.110
Why did you put me and Rio through this?

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:24.070
I merely followed thine orders.

00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:28.740
Thine orders to restore thine memories.

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:29.790
My orders?!

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:32.750
Hey! What do you mean?! Hey!

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:38.800
<i>This is my Number...?</i>

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:39.800
<i>This can't be...</i>

00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:43.760
Ryouga Kamishiro... Rio...

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:46.600
Wh-What is this?

00:20:52.180 --> 00:20:53.480
Guys...

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:56.400
Huh?!

00:20:59.730 --> 00:21:01.400
Huh? Kotori!

00:21:01.900 --> 00:21:03.450
Yuma! Guys!

00:21:03.450 --> 00:21:05.490
We came back?

00:21:05.490 --> 00:21:06.160
Rio?!

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:07.620
I was so worried!

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:11.160
Rio!

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:16.460
Rio!!

00:21:21.050 --> 00:21:27.140
It would seem that the remaining two Numbers have fallen into Astral's and the others' hands.

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:28.680
What did you say?!

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:30.970
But do not worry.

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:34.310
Those two will eventually return to our side.

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:37.560
What the hell do you know?!

00:21:38.270 --> 00:21:41.900
Everything. Everything there is to know about you.

00:21:42.480 --> 00:21:48.820
Everything you felt at those ruins
 from back when you were human.

00:21:48.820 --> 00:21:49.950
You mean me?!

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:57.960
And how you killed Nash and Merag after you were reincarnated in the Barian World!

00:21:59.540 --> 00:22:01.040
You bastard!

00:22:01.040 --> 00:22:05.470
More importantly, you must search for Number 96!

00:22:05.470 --> 00:22:08.510
That guy should be about ready to make his move!

00:22:21.150 --> 00:22:23.650
<i>Is it the world that's boring?</i>

00:22:23.650 --> 00:22:26.190
<i>Or maybe you're the one who's not gettin' serious?</i>

00:22:26.190 --> 00:22:27.400
<i>Do you understand?</i>

00:22:27.400 --> 00:22:28.820
<i>Do I understand?</i>

00:22:29.030 --> 00:22:31.700
<i>Already got my answers</i>

00:22:31.740 --> 00:22:34.200
<i>Once you start movin', you ain't stoppin'</i>

00:22:34.200 --> 00:22:36.750
<i>I go on thinkin' even while losin'.</i>

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:37.830
<i>Do you understand?</i>

00:22:37.830 --> 00:22:38.870
<i>I understand!</i>

00:22:38.870 --> 00:22:42.250
<i>Our formula for reversal's already gathered</i>

00:22:42.250 --> 00:22:44.590
<i>You afraid it ain't comin' true?</i>

00:22:44.590 --> 00:22:47.720
<i>I gotta 'least give it a try</i>

00:22:47.720 --> 00:22:49.930
<i>Ain't no problem if they say I'm borin'</i>

00:22:49.930 --> 00:22:52.930
<i>True failure's when we stop movin'</i>

00:22:53.100 --> 00:22:54.890
<i>Come on! Ga, ga, ga, guys & dolls</i>

00:22:54.890 --> 00:22:56.270
<i>Go, go, go, go my way</i>

00:22:56.270 --> 00:22:58.140
<i>Oh, oh, oh, over ray</i>

00:22:58.440 --> 00:23:02.440
<i>Door's always open for you</i>

00:23:02.610 --> 00:23:07.530
<i>Bring your power forth and go way, go way</i>

00:23:07.530 --> 00:23:08.780
<i>I understand!</i>

00:23:08.780 --> 00:23:12.780
<i>And tears are no way, no way</i>

00:23:13.280 --> 00:23:18.160
<i>With all my strength, pave way, go way</i>

00:23:18.160 --> 00:23:19.370
<i>I understand!</i>

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:23.500
<i>Got all the courage here</i>

00:23:23.500 --> 00:23:25.670
<i>You ought to understand!</i>

00:23:25.670 --> 00:23:27.880
<i>Go way, go way</i>

00:23:40.390 --> 00:23:43.810
Right now, the world is starting to be consumed by darkness.

00:23:44.270 --> 00:23:47.400
We're about to have the final Duel against Number 96.

00:23:47.940 --> 00:23:51.820
At last, the time has come for our fated confrontation.

00:23:51.820 --> 00:23:53.320
What are those eyes?!

00:23:53.320 --> 00:23:54.870
We're being sucked into the sky!

00:23:54.870 --> 00:23:56.990
What is this space?!

00:23:56.990 --> 00:23:59.750
We'll decide this quickly with Hope Ray V!

00:24:00.460 --> 00:24:02.210
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II!

00:24:02.210 --> 00:24:06.040
"Three Worlds on the Verge of Destruction! Ultimate Rampage - Numbers 96!!"

00:24:06.040 --> 00:24:08.420
He stole our Numbers!
